title: The host's assistant shows on the guest's canvas where it works, marked as the host's, and the guest follows it; the guest's own assistant shows on the host's; one working outside the shared folders is not sent
folders: share-text
limit: 80
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: share: 1 of the assistants of Beto on the canvas
guest-expect-log: share: 1 of the assistants of .+ on the canvas
forbid-log: share: 2 of the assistants

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 6000
agent {"agent":"h1","name":"Codex","task":"Tidy the notes","action":"read","path":"{FIX}/share-text/notes.txt","line":3,"lines":4,"note":"looking for typos"}
agent {"agent":"h2","name":"Codex","task":"Something private","action":"read","path":"{WORK}/elsewhere/secret.txt","line":1}
wait 5000
agent {"agent":"h1","name":"Codex","task":"Tidy the notes","action":"edit","path":"{FIX}/share-text/src/lib.rs","line":5,"lines":3}
wait 6000
fit
wait 1500
mark host-sees-the-guests-assistant
wait 6000
quit
wait 1500
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 6000
fit
wait 1500
mark sees-the-hosts-assistant
wait 1000
agent Tidy the notes
wait 5000
mark follows-the-hosts-assistant
wait 1000
agent {"agent":"g1","name":"Claude Code","task":"Write the docs","action":"edit","path":"docs/deep/inner.txt","line":1,"lines":2}
wait 8000
quit
wait 1500
